caption: Holidays

Holidays

Midsummer: You ask Sister Flame to retreat and Father Sky to bring the rains of autumn.

Harvest: Give thanks to Mother Earth.

Winter Solstice: Give thanks to Friend Darkness for keeping the monsters away, plead for 
Father Sky to bring back the sun.

Spring: Praise Brother Sea and Father Sky for the rains, Plead for Mother Earth to bring fertility to the land.
